                <pb facs="0997" n="987" sameAs="frus:frus1947v07/pg987"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.34/12–747: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-12-08T11:00:00-05:00">December 8,
                            1947—11 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1483. In light Urtel 2346 December 7 Navy agreeable to release text of agreement
                    and exchange of notes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
